|-----------|---------------------|------------|-----------|-----------|
| **ОБ** (`future-vision`) | No | Yes | No | No |
| **МД** (`marathon-of-good`) | Yes | No | Yes | Yes (v1) |
| **Projects** (`team-projects`) | No | Yes | Yes | No |
| **Feedback** (`support`) | Yes | No | No | No |

Costs are standard (1) except Feedback, where free defaults are possible. Full per-hub settings: @business-mvp.mdc.

