## Permission Quick Reference

| Action | Check |
|--------|-------|
| Publish | `permissionRules` allow action + `settings.postCost` payable (quota first if `canPayPostFromQuota`, else wallet; global context) |
| Comment/Vote | `permissionRules` allow action + `votingSettings.currencySource` + `settings.commentMode` |
| Self-vote | `permissionRules.conditions.canVoteForOwnPosts` + wallet-only constraint; effectively unavailable when `votingSettings.currencySource === 'quota-only'` |
| Withdraw | `settings.allowWithdraw` (checked before other authorization) |
| Tappalka | `tappalkaSettings.enabled` + post can pay show cost — not a simple `minRating` gate, see @business-tappalka.mdc |

**Implementation notes (current code):** post rating withdrawal = `publications.withdraw`; comment (vote) score withdrawal = `votes.withdrawFromVote`; `votes.withdraw` is deprecated; `wallets.withdraw` / `wallets.transfer` return `NOT_IMPLEMENTED`. There is no dedicated `commentFee` / `commentCost` — vote amounts and direction rules drive balance changes.
